      "kind": "realm-trail",
      "text": "Operate the west handle on the broad grounded apron beyond the Mirror Causeway. Its single notch marks the first isolated support. Set the east and crown relays in either order; all three are required before the service core wakes. The west Arcade service walk remains another way back to the Garden."
